 That run has 1 failure (`tests/session/test_env_completer.py::test_register_env_select_attaches_completer`) and 7 errors (`tests/session/cmd/test_schema.py`, the tombi lint tests). I didn't confirm they also fail without my changes. They look unrelated to `set_env`, and the schema errors look like an environment problem, but that is my reading, not something I verified.\n\nChanges by file:\n- **`src/tox/config/set_env.py`:** added `SetEnvReference`, `SetEnv.extend`, `SetEnv.raw` and the lazy resolution of env files, override blocks and references. Details beyond the spec:\n  - `_resolve_replacements` is split into helpers (`_entries_of`, `_resolve_reference_entries`).\n  - `__iter__` snapshots the not-yet-materialized exported keys before it starts yielding. I added this because an export callback that reads another export would otherwise make that second key drop out of the iteration.\n- **`src/tox/config/loader/api.py`:** `Loader.load` no longer delays replacement; it builds `set_env` overrides through the new `_build_override` and merges appended ones with `extend`. `set_env_reference` handles references, including the circular-reference error.\n- **`src/tox/config/loader/ini/replace.py`:** an overridden `set_env` reached through a reference is rebuilt with the override rules and written back as `key=value; marker` lines.\n- **`src/tox/config/loader/toml/_api.py` and `_replace.py`:** TOML references to an overridden `set_env` become `SetEnvReference`s, and `Unroll` runs the array shape check with the spec's error message.\n- **`src/tox/config/sets.py`:** `set_env_post_process` now exports `PYTHONIOENCODING`, and `set_env_factory` accepts references.\n\nI left the four test files, docs and everything else listed as out of scope untouched.", "ttft_ms": 1742, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 268867, "uuid": "0637d6b5-1635-4abd-ad92-2cd1a57a943e", "ttft_stream_ms": 1025, "time_to_request_ms": 56, "first_content_frame_ms": 1026, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
